{
    "title": "Bible Trivia",
    "description": "What does the application offer? \r\n\u2022 More than 1100 Multiple Choice questions\r\n\u2022 650 'True or false?' questions\r\n\u2022 600 'Guess the word' levels\r\n\u2022 8 Game Modes\r\n\u2022 Today's championship competition\r\n\u2022 Achievements, Leaderboards and Statistics\r\n\u2022 You can play offline\r\n\u2022 There are many others, but I don't want to bore you\r\n\r\nIf you want to read more:\r\nDaily Bible Trivia is made to test your knowledge of bible and learn more about Christianity in a fun way. If you like fun quizzes on religions, this is a perfect past time app for you! A variety of Daily Bible Trivia questions - guess the quote, name Christian saints, answer questions about psalms and proverbs, hymns and so much more. What are the ten commandments of God? How many books of Moses are there? Who were Samson and Delilah? What is the story of Noah and the Ark? Download Bible quiz questions and answers for kids and adults and test your knowledge right now! Find out how much you really remember all the biblical stories and test your memory with this fascinating mind game.\r\n\r\nUnderstanding the Bible scriptures is essential for every religious person. For some, this is the impossible quiz challenge! The most interesting Christian quiz on The Holy Bible Old and New testaments are now at the palm of your hand! Interesting and intelligent questions and answers will help you learn all the important facts about Christianity. Gain knowledge on the largest of religions of the world with new Bible quiz - religious game for everyone. Smart quizzes are an excellent way to improve your general knowledge and IQ - get some real brain training and educate yourself! You don't even have to be online to play - download the intelligent Daily Bible Trivia quiz app and then play without internet any time you want! Get this smart app for free to check how much you really remember your church reading.\r\n\r\nBible quiz a good way to grow faith and have fun at the same time through interesting quiz games. Challenge your way through trivia questions developed to start easy and get so difficult that even the most knowledgeable Bible scholars will be challenged by the final level questions in the game. It\u2019s great for Sunday School use, too, because you can play a bit free, every day.  Christian scholars rely upon knowledge to understand God\u2019s plan for mankind, where Jesus is the way, truth and the life. Whether you are a Christian or not, you will enjoy learning while playing this Jeopardy! like game. And it\u2019s great for kids, too.\r\n\r\nHow well do you know your Bible? But perhaps, the best question is, do you have what it takes to know Jesus and His word through learning, the more you play? Play to learn more about the key pillars of Christianity and the faith by playing through the Word of God. Whether the Creation, Adam & Eve, Moses, the Exodus, Noah\u2019s Ark, The Story of Joseph, Abraham & Isaac, Samson, Ruth, Esther, Nehemiah, King David and so many other Old Testament texts, or New Testament content about the life of Jesus, new wine or if you just want a quality Christian game, this Jeopardy! type of game is right for you.\r\n\r\nThere are 8 game modes available. Solve the words by the Guess The Word game mode, answer the True Or False facts, or choose one of the regular game mode to answer New Testament, Old Testament or Basic Questions. You can also check how many questions you can answer within 5 minutes or compete with others to become Today's Champion, or learn through Divine Mode.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n1.\t Easy and quick to play\r\n2.\t Challenging and interesting\r\n3.\t Free to play for all generations\r\n4.\t Amazing graphics and animations\r\n5.\t Gain extra bonus\r\n6.\t Keep a track of your stats and progress\r\n7.\t Share with friends\r\n8.\t 8 game modes available\r\n9.\t Check your history\r\n10.\t True or False\r\n11.\t Time limited as well as unlimited mode\r\n12.\t Play without internet connection.\r\n13.\t Show result if you have answered it right or wrong!\r\n14.\t Calculation of your scores at the end of each quiz.\r\n15.\t Best user interface.\r\n16.\t Easy to use.",
