a good way to grow faith and have fun at the same time through interesting quiz games. Challenge your way through trivia questions developed to start easy and get so difficult that even the most knowledgeable Bible scholars will be challenged by the final level questions in the game. It\u2019s great for Sunday School use, too, because you can play a bit free, every day.  Christian scholars rely upon knowledge to understand God\u2019s plan for mankind, where Jesus is the way, truth and the life. Whether you are a Christian or not, you will enjoy learning while playing this Jeopardy! like game. And it\u2019s great for kids, too.<br><br>How well do you know your Bible? But perhaps, the best question is, do you have what it takes to know Jesus and His word through learning, the more you play? Play to learn more about the key pillars of Christianity and the faith by playing through the Word of God. Whether the Creation, Adam &amp; Eve, Moses, the Exodus, Noah\u2019s Ark, The Story of Joseph, Abraham &amp; Isaac, Samson, Ruth, Esther, Nehemiah, King David and so many other Old Testament texts, or New Testament content about the life of Jesus, new wine or if you just want a quality Christian game, this Jeopardy! type of game is right for you.<br><br>There are 8 game modes available. Solve the words by the Guess The Word game mode, answer the True Or False facts, or choose one of the regular game mode to answer New Testament, Old Testament or Basic Questions. You can also check how many questions you can answer within 5 minutes or compete with others to become Today&#39;s Champion, or learn through Divine Mode.<br><br>Features:<br>1.\t Easy and quick to play<br>2.\t Challenging and interesting<br>3.\t Free to play for all generations<br>4.\t Amazing graphics and animations<br>5.\t Gain extra bonus<br>6.\t Keep a track of your stats and progress<br>7.\t Share with friends<br>8.\t 8 game modes available<br>9.\t Check your history<br>10.\t True or False<br>11.\t Time limited a